---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="portfolio-container">
		<section class="hero">
			<div class="eyebrow"><span class="availability-dot"></span>Available for remote roles & freelance projects</div>
			<h1>Android products that feel <em>as good as they work.</em></h1>
			<h2>I'm Ali Ansar, a Native Android & Full-Stack Engineer.</h2>
			<p>From the first screen to the backend that powers it, I build reliable mobile products with thoughtful UX, clean architecture, and production-ready engineering.</p>
			
			<div class="cta-buttons">
				<a href="#contact" class="btn primary">Start a conversation <span>&rarr;</span></a>
				<a href="#projects" class="btn secondary">Explore my work</a>
				<a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn resume-link" download>Download résumé <span>&darr;</span></a>
			</div>
			<div class="hero-proof">
				<span>Android-first</span>
				<span>End-to-end thinking</span>
				<span>Built for scale</span>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="expertise" id="expertise">
			<div class="section-intro">
				<span class="section-label">What I bring</span>
				<h2>Full-stack Android expertise</h2>
				<p>A practical toolkit for taking an idea from product thinking to a polished, maintainable release.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="expertise-grid">
				<article class="expertise-card">
					<span class="expertise-number">01</span>
					<h3>Native Android</h3>
					<p>Modern, responsive mobile experiences built for real users and real devices.</p>
					<div class="skill-list"><span>Kotlin</span><span>Jetpack Compose</span><span>Material Design</span><span>Coroutines & Flow</span><span>Navigation</span></div>
				</article>
				<article class="expertise-card">
					<span class="expertise-number">02</span>
					<h3>Architecture & quality</h3>
					<p>Codebases that stay understandable as features, teams, and users grow.</p>
					<div class="skill-list"><span>Clean Architecture</span><span>MVVM</span><span>State Management</span><span>Hilt / DI</span><span>Unit Testing</span></div>
				</article>
				<article class="expertise-card">
					<span class="expertise-number">03</span>
					<h3>Backend & data</h3>
					<p>Connected applications with dependable data flows, authentication, and persistence.</p>
					<div class="skill-list"><span>REST APIs</span><span>Retrofit</span><span>Firebase</span><span>Firestore</span><span>Room Database</span></div>
				</article>
				<article class="expertise-card">
					<span class="expertise-number">04</span>
					<h3>Delivery & collaboration</h3>
					<p>Clear communication and disciplined delivery from discovery through release.</p>
					<div class="skill-list"><span>Git & GitHub</span><span>API Integration</span><span>Agile Workflow</span><span>Debugging</span><span>Performance</span></div>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="projects" id="projects">
			<div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-label">Selected work</span><h2>Projects with purpose</h2></div><a href="#contact" class="text-link">Have a project? Let’s talk &rarr;</a></div>
			
			<a href="/projects/campusnotify" class="project-card highlight project-card-link">
				<span class="tag">Flagship Platform</span>
				<h3>CampusNotify</h3>
				<p>A fully functional, comprehensive campus communication ecosystem featuring dedicated Student and Admin Dashboards.</p>
				<div class="tech-stack">
					<span>Native Android</span>
					<span>Clean Architecture</span>
					<span>Firebase</span>
				</div>
				<div class="card-cta">View Full Case Study &rarr;</div>
			</a>

			<div class="project-card">
				<h3>Semesta</h3>
				<p>An advanced native Android application showcasing modern UI patterns, modular architecture, and robust state management for a smooth user experience.</p>
				<div class="tech-stack">
					<span>Jetpack Compose</span>
					<span>Clean Architecture</span>
					<span>Kotlin</span>
				</div>
				<div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
					<a href="/projects/semesta" class="btn primary" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">View Full Case Study &rarr;</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<a href="/projects/flashcard-quiz" class="project-card project-card-link">
				<h3>Flash Quiz Card</h3>
				<p>An interactive utility application built for active learning and efficient retention, featuring dynamic card flipping logic and performance tracking.</p>
				<div class="tech-stack">
					<span>Jetpack Compose</span>
					<span>Room Database</span>
					<span>Clean Architecture</span>
				</div>
				<div class="card-cta">View Full Case Study &rarr;</div>
			</a>

			<a href="/projects/asterloom" class="project-card project-card-link">
				<h3>Asterloom</h3>
				<p>A modern Android application focused on intuitive navigation, polished UI, reusable components, and scalable development practices.</p>
				<div class="tech-stack">
					<span>Jetpack Compose</span>
					<span>MVVM</span>
					<span>Clean Architecture</span>
				</div>
				<div class="card-cta">View Full Case Study &rarr;</div>
			</a>
		</section>

		<section class="contact-section" id="contact">
			<div class="contact-copy">
				<span class="section-label">Let’s work together</span>
				<h2>Have an idea worth building?</h2>
				<p>Whether you’re hiring an Android engineer or shaping a new product, I’m open to thoughtful conversations about the problem, the users, and the best way forward.</p>
				<div class="contact-actions"><a href="mailto:aliedits1129@gmail.com" class="btn primary">Email me <span>&rarr;</span></a><a href="https://wa.me/923479951664" target="_blank" class="btn whatsapp">Message on WhatsApp</a></div>
			</div>
			
			<div class="contact-grid">
				<div class="contact-item">
					<strong>Phone / WhatsApp:</strong>
					<a href="tel:+923479951664">+92 347 9951664</a>
				</div>
				<div class="contact-item">
					<strong>Email:</strong>
					<a href="mailto:aliedits1129@gmail.com">aliedits1129@gmail.com</a>
				</div>
				<div class="contact-item">
					<strong>GitHub:</strong>
					<a href="https://github.com/Neurobyte2" target="_blank">github.com/Neurobyte2</a>
				</div>
				<div class="contact-item">
					<strong>LinkedIn:</strong>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ali-ansar-536153366" target="_blank">Connect professionally</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	body {
		font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
		background: #090d16;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		line-height: 1.6;
		overflow-x: hidden;
	}
	*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
	.portfolio-container {
		max-width: 1040px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 2rem 5rem;
	}
	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		width: 100%;
		min-height: 590px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
		position: relative;
	}
	.hero::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 5% 12% 8%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.11), transparent 65%);
		z-index: -1;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		display: inline-block;
		background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08);
		color: #38bdf8;
		padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 50px;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
	}
	.availability-dot {
		display: inline-block;
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		background: #22c55e;
		border-radius: 50%;
		margin-right: 0.45rem;
	}
	.hero h1 {
		font-size: clamp(3.1rem, 7vw, 5.8rem);
		line-height: 0.98;
		max-width: 850px;
		margin: 2rem 0 1.5rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
	}
	.hero h1 em {
		color: #38bdf8;
		font-style: normal;
	}
	.hero h2 {
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
		color: #e2e8f0;
		margin: 0 0 1rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.hero p {
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
		max-width: 670px;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem;
	}
	.cta-buttons {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.85rem;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.btn {
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.btn span { margin-left: 0.4rem; }
	.btn.primary {
		background-color: #38bdf8;
		color: #090d16;
	}
	.btn.primary:hover {
		background-color: #0ea5e9;
	}
	.btn.secondary {
		background-color: #1e293b;
		color: #f1f5f9;
		border: 1px solid #334155;
	}
	.btn.resume-link {
		color: #cbd5e1;
		border: 1px solid #334155;
		background: transparent;
	}
	.btn.whatsapp {
		background-color: #22c55e;
		color: #ffffff;
	}
	.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
	.hero-proof {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2.2rem;
		color: #64748b;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}
	.hero-proof span + span::before { content: '•'; color: #38bdf8; margin-right: 1.5rem; }
	.section-label {
		color: #38bdf8;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	.section-intro { max-width: 610px; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
	.section-intro h2, .section-heading h2 {
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0.55rem 0 0.5rem;
	}
	.section-intro p { color: #94a3b8; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; }
	.expertise { padding: 2rem 0 5rem; }
	.expertise-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; }
	.expertise-card {
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: #0e1522;
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
	}
	.expertise-number { color: #38bdf8; font: 700 0.75rem system-ui, sans-serif; }
	.expertise-card h3 { color: #fff; font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 1.8rem 0 0.6rem; }
	.expertise-card p { color: #94a3b8; font: 0.9rem/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; min-height: 4.1rem; }
	.skill-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; }
	.skill-list span { color: #cbd5e1; background: #1f2937; border-radius: 999px; padding: 0.3rem 0.55rem; font: 0.7rem system-ui, sans-serif; }
	.projects { padding: 2rem 0; }
	.section-heading { display: flex; align-items: end; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
	.text-link { color: #38bdf8; font: 600 0.85rem system-ui, sans-serif; text-decoration: none; }
	.text-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
	.projects h2, .contact-section h2 {
		font-size: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		color: #ffffff;
	}
	.project-card {
		background-color: #111827;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;
		position: relative;
		transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.project-card-link {
		display: block;
		text-decoration: none;
		color: inherit;
	}
	.card-cta {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		display: inline-block;
		padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		background-color: #38bdf8;
		color: #090d16;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.project-card:hover {
		border-color: #38bdf8;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}
	.project-card.highlight {
		border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827 0%, #162032 100%);
	}
	.tag {
		background: #0284c7;
		color: #ffffff;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: bold;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}
	.project-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem 0;
		color: #38bdf8;
	}
	.project-card p {
		color: #94a3b8;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}
	.tech-stack {
		display: flex;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.tech-stack span {
		background: #1f2937;
		color: #cbd5e1;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
	}
	.contact-section {
		margin-top: 5rem;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #111827, #0e1b2b);
		padding: 3.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		border: 1px solid #1f2937;
		text-align: left;
	}
	.contact-copy { max-width: 650px; }
	.contact-copy h2 { margin: 0.55rem 0 0.75rem; }
	.contact-section p {
		color: #94a3b8;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
	}
	.contact-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
	.contact-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.5rem;
		text-align: left;
	}
	.contact-item {
		background: #1f2937;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
	}
	.contact-item strong {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: #94a3b8;
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
	}
	.contact-item a {
		color: #38bdf8;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	.contact-item a:hover {
		text-decoration: underline;
	}
	@media (max-width: 800px) {
		.expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.portfolio-container { padding: 1rem 1.25rem 3rem; }
		.hero { min-height: auto; padding: 4rem 0 5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
		.hero::before { inset: 8% -20% 8%; }
		.eyebrow { max-width: 100%; padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.7rem; line-height: 1.35; }
		.hero h1 { width: 100%; max-width: 22rem; font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 13vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.02; margin: 1.5rem auto 1.25rem; }
		.hero h2, .hero p { width: 100%; }
		.hero h2 { font-size: 0.98rem; line-height: 1.45; }
		.hero p { max-width: 34rem; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; }
		.cta-buttons, .contact-actions { width: 100%; flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
		.cta-buttons .btn, .contact-actions .btn { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
		.hero-proof { gap: 0.35rem 0.7rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; font-size: 0.65rem; line-height: 1.4; }
		.hero-proof span + span::before { margin-right: 0.7rem; }
		.expertise-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.expertise { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; }
		.section-intro h2, .section-heading h2 { font-size: 1.85rem; line-height: 1.15; }
		.expertise-card { padding: 1.25rem; }
		.expertise-card h3 { margin-top: 1.25rem; }
		.expertise-card p { min-height: 0; }
		.section-heading { display: block; }
		.text-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
		.project-card { padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.75rem; }
		.project-card h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; }
		.project-card p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
		.tech-stack span { font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem; }
		.card-cta { font-size: 0.8rem; }
		.contact-section { padding: 2rem 1.25rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
		.contact-section h2 { font-size: 1.85rem; line-height: 1.15; }
		.contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
		.contact-item { padding: 0.9rem 1rem; }
	}
</style>